{"name": "Goobies 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Goobies 2 is a third-person, co-op roguelike where you battle  blobs and bosses. Unlock goobies, mutations, omens and skins. Make unique builds and splatter blobs while seeking out the creator through the beautiful blobverse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.poster.avif?t=1781593831\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.webm?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/c5c2f24c506727af79e45916e55d215a.mp4?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Goobies come in all shapes and forms, each with unique abilities and playstyles. Choose from the original goobies or discover new beings of goo!<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"370\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.poster.avif?t=1781593831\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.webm?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565090/extras/7b716fab6530fa33be96d4414ddf9b39.mp4?t=1781593831\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your goobie with mutated genes. Each gene 